{
 "fps": 30,
 "durationInFrames": 22046,
 "seconds": 734.87,
 "cues": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "start": 0.6,
   "end": 3.74,
   "startFrame": 18,
   "endFrame": 112,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "At six-oh-two in the morning, my phone let out an alarm."
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "start": 4.29,
   "end": 6.78,
   "startFrame": 129,
   "endFrame": 203,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "I woke up, reaching for it on the table."
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "start": 7.33,
   "end": 9.59,
   "startFrame": 220,
   "endFrame": 288,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "The screen showed an emergency alert."
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "start": 9.94,
   "end": 14.368,
   "startFrame": 298,
   "endFrame": 431,
   "words": 15,
   "text": "Residents were told to stay inside, lock their doors, and wait for the next update."
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "start": 14.918,
   "end": 16.745,
   "startFrame": 448,
   "endFrame": 502,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "I called a few numbers I knew."
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "start": 17.095,
   "end": 18.36,
   "startFrame": 513,
   "endFrame": 551,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "No one answered."
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "start": 18.71,
   "end": 22.194,
   "startFrame": 561,
   "endFrame": 666,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "On the building's resident chat, messages kept jumping in."
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "start": 22.544,
   "end": 24.588,
   "startFrame": 676,
   "endFrame": 738,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "Someone asked what was happening."
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "start": 24.938,
   "end": 26.981,
   "startFrame": 748,
   "endFrame": 809,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "Someone said not to go outside."
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "start": 27.331,
   "end": 31.555,
   "startFrame": 820,
   "endFrame": 947,
   "words": 14,
   "text": "A video someone had just posted was deleted before I could finish watching it."
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "start": 32.105,
   "end": 33.498,
   "startFrame": 963,
   "endFrame": 1005,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "I went to the window."
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "start": 34.048,
   "end": 36.818,
   "startFrame": 1021,
   "endFrame": 1105,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "Down on the street, a car rear-ended another."
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "start": 37.168,
   "end": 39.186,
   "startFrame": 1115,
   "endFrame": 1176,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "The driver abandoned it and ran."
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "start": 39.536,
   "end": 43.097,
   "startFrame": 1186,
   "endFrame": 1293,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "Near the corner store, a few people were struggling with each other."
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "start": 43.447,
   "end": 46.268,
   "startFrame": 1303,
   "endFrame": 1388,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "One of them fell, and the rest scattered fast."
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "start": 46.818,
   "end": 49.984,
   "startFrame": 1405,
   "endFrame": 1500,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "I pulled the curtain shut and went back to lock the door."
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "start": 50.534,
   "end": 52.092,
   "startFrame": 1516,
   "endFrame": 1563,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "I meant to stay inside."
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "start": 52.642,
   "end": 56.688,
   "startFrame": 1579,
   "endFrame": 1701,
   "words": 14,
   "text": "About ten minutes later, there was pounding on a door somewhere down the hallway."
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "start": 57.038,
   "end": 59.528,
   "startFrame": 1711,
   "endFrame": 1786,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "A man was calling for someone to let him in."
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "start": 59.878,
   "end": 62.253,
   "startFrame": 1796,
   "endFrame": 1868,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "I went closer and looked through the peephole."
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "start": 62.803,
   "end": 67.665,
   "startFrame": 1884,
   "endFrame": 2030,
   "words": 17,
   "text": "He was standing in front of the apartment across from mine, one hand holding the other arm."
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "start": 68.015,
   "end": 70.05799999999999,
   "startFrame": 2040,
   "endFrame": 2102,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "Blood was dripping onto the floor."
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "start": 70.608,
   "end": 73.787,
   "startFrame": 2118,
   "endFrame": 2214,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "Before I could do anything, the stairwell door burst open."
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "start": 74.337,
   "end": 75.755,
   "startFrame": 2230,
   "endFrame": 2273,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "Someone came out."
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "start": 76.105,
   "end": 77.179,
   "startFrame": 2283,
   "endFrame": 2315,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "Then another."
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "start": 77.729,
   "end": 81.96600000000001,
   "startFrame": 2332,
   "endFrame": 2459,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "The man turned, pressed himself against the door, and started pounding harder."
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "start": 82.51599999999999,
   "end": 85.605,
   "startFrame": 2475,
   "endFrame": 2568,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "I pulled back from the peephole when the screaming started."
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "start": 86.155,
   "end": 89.703,
   "startFrame": 2585,
   "endFrame": 2691,
   "words": 14,
   "text": "Standing in the middle of the room, I heard thuds out in the hallway."
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "start": 90.053,
   "end": 93.00200000000001,
   "startFrame": 2702,
   "endFrame": 2790,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "A moment later, someone touched my own door handle."
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "start": 93.55199999999999,
   "end": 95.914,
   "startFrame": 2807,
   "endFrame": 2877,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "The handle dipped, then sprang back up."
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "start": 96.464,
   "end": 98.048,
   "startFrame": 2894,
   "endFrame": 2941,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "I backed into the kitchen."
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "start": 98.598,
   "end": 101.981,
   "startFrame": 2958,
   "endFrame": 3059,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "The apartment had a back door that led to a service stairwell."
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "start": 102.331,
   "end": 105.203,
   "startFrame": 3070,
   "endFrame": 3156,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "I had never used it except to take out the trash."
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "start": 105.553,
   "end": 111.997,
   "startFrame": 3167,
   "endFrame": 3360,
   "words": 24,
   "text": "I grabbed my backpack, put in two bottles of water, a few snack bars still in the cupboard, and the flashlight by the bed."
  },
  {
   "i": 34,
   "start": 112.547,
   "end": 114.667,
   "startFrame": 3376,
   "endFrame": 3440,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "There was no time to message anyone."
  },
  {
   "i": 35,
   "start": 115.217,
   "end": 117.898,
   "startFrame": 3457,
   "endFrame": 3537,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "Outside the front door, there was movement again."
  },
  {
   "i": 36,
   "start": 118.44800000000001,
   "end": 122.06,
   "startFrame": 3553,
   "endFrame": 3662,
   "words": 15,
   "text": "I went out through the back, and pulled it shut as quietly as I could."
  },
  {
   "i": 37,
   "start": 122.61,
   "end": 125.903,
   "startFrame": 3678,
   "endFrame": 3777,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "The service stairwell led down to an alley behind the building."
  },
  {
   "i": 38,
   "start": 126.453,
   "end": 128.037,
   "startFrame": 3794,
   "endFrame": 3841,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "There were people there too."
  },
  {
   "i": 39,
   "start": 128.387,
   "end": 131.234,
   "startFrame": 3852,
   "endFrame": 3937,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "A couple was helping an old woman into a car."
  },
  {
   "i": 40,
   "start": 131.584,
   "end": 136.254,
   "startFrame": 3948,
   "endFrame": 4088,
   "words": 17,
   "text": "The man told me to avoid the main road, there had been an accident at the intersection."
  },
  {
   "i": 41,
   "start": 136.804,
   "end": 138.414,
   "startFrame": 4104,
   "endFrame": 4152,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "I asked where I should go."
  },
  {
   "i": 42,
   "start": 138.964,
   "end": 140.931,
   "startFrame": 4169,
   "endFrame": 4228,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "He pointed toward the shopping mall."
  },
  {
   "i": 43,
   "start": 141.481,
   "end": 143.498,
   "startFrame": 4244,
   "endFrame": 4305,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "\"They're letting people in over there.\""
  },
  {
   "i": 44,
   "start": 144.048,
   "end": 145.314,
   "startFrame": 4321,
   "endFrame": 4359,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "I went that way."
  },
  {
   "i": 45,
   "start": 145.864,
   "end": 148.761,
   "startFrame": 4376,
   "endFrame": 4463,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "From a distance, I could see the lights were still on."
  },
  {
   "i": 46,
   "start": 149.111,
   "end": 152.66,
   "startFrame": 4473,
   "endFrame": 4580,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "A security guard stood at the door, waving people inside."
  },
  {
   "i": 47,
   "start": 153.01,
   "end": 159.772,
   "startFrame": 4590,
   "endFrame": 4793,
   "words": 24,
   "text": "After what had just happened outside my apartment, just seeing someone in uniform still doing their job was enough to make me feel lighter."
  },
  {
   "i": 48,
   "start": 160.322,
   "end": 163.361,
   "startFrame": 4810,
   "endFrame": 4901,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "Inside, it was crowded, but not yet chaotic."
  },
  {
   "i": 49,
   "start": 163.711,
   "end": 165.575,
   "startFrame": 4911,
   "endFrame": 4967,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "People sat along the hallway."
  },
  {
   "i": 50,
   "start": 165.925,
   "end": 168.734,
   "startFrame": 4978,
   "endFrame": 5062,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "A child was having her face wiped by her mother."
  },
  {
   "i": 51,
   "start": 169.084,
   "end": 172.224,
   "startFrame": 5073,
   "endFrame": 5167,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "Staff pushed small kiosks aside to clear a path."
  },
  {
   "i": 52,
   "start": 172.774,
   "end": 176.424,
   "startFrame": 5183,
   "endFrame": 5293,
   "words": 16,
   "text": "I found a spot near the wall and took out my phone to try calling again."
  },
  {
   "i": 53,
   "start": 176.974,
   "end": 178.035,
   "startFrame": 5309,
   "endFrame": 5341,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "Still nothing."
  },
  {
   "i": 54,
   "start": 178.585,
   "end": 182.912,
   "startFrame": 5358,
   "endFrame": 5487,
   "words": 14,
   "text": "A staff member pushed a water cart past, telling everyone to take one bottle."
  },
  {
   "i": 55,
   "start": 183.262,
   "end": 186.236,
   "startFrame": 5498,
   "endFrame": 5587,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "I took one, and asked if she knew what was happening."
  },
  {
   "i": 56,
   "start": 186.786,
   "end": 188.064,
   "startFrame": 5604,
   "endFrame": 5642,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "She shook her head."
  },
  {
   "i": 57,
   "start": 188.614,
   "end": 189.892,
   "startFrame": 5658,
   "endFrame": 5697,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "\"We're waiting too.\""
  },
  {
   "i": 58,
   "start": 190.442,
   "end": 191.618,
   "startFrame": 5713,
   "endFrame": 5749,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "I sat down."
  },
  {
   "i": 59,
   "start": 191.968,
   "end": 195.746,
   "startFrame": 5759,
   "endFrame": 5872,
   "words": 14,
   "text": "For a few minutes, I thought I could stay here until things became clearer."
  },
  {
   "i": 60,
   "start": 196.296,
   "end": 199.117,
   "startFrame": 5889,
   "endFrame": 5974,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "Then, somewhere upstairs, someone screamed."
  },
  {
   "i": 61,
   "start": 199.667,
   "end": 202.578,
   "startFrame": 5990,
   "endFrame": 6077,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "At first, only a few people stood up to look."
  },
  {
   "i": 62,
   "start": 203.128,
   "end": 206.778,
   "startFrame": 6094,
   "endFrame": 6203,
   "words": 13,
   "text": "Then someone came running down the escalator and fell right at the bottom."
  },
  {
   "i": 63,
   "start": 207.128,
   "end": 209.209,
   "startFrame": 6214,
   "endFrame": 6276,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "The person behind tripped over them."
  },
  {
   "i": 64,
   "start": 209.559,
   "end": 211.641,
   "startFrame": 6287,
   "endFrame": 6349,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "The screaming spread down the hallway."
  },
  {
   "i": 65,
   "start": 212.191,
   "end": 214.719,
   "startFrame": 6366,
   "endFrame": 6442,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "I stood up, trying to see the main entrance."
  },
  {
   "i": 66,
   "start": 215.269,
   "end": 218.09,
   "startFrame": 6458,
   "endFrame": 6543,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "People from the doors were now running back inside."
  },
  {
   "i": 67,
   "start": 218.64,
   "end": 221.423,
   "startFrame": 6559,
   "endFrame": 6643,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "I didn't know which direction was more dangerous."
  },
  {
   "i": 68,
   "start": 221.773,
   "end": 225.602,
   "startFrame": 6653,
   "endFrame": 6768,
   "words": 15,
   "text": "When the people next to me surged toward the stairwell door, I went with them."
  },
  {
   "i": 69,
   "start": 226.152,
   "end": 229.012,
   "startFrame": 6785,
   "endFrame": 6870,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "We made it down one floor before the whole line stopped."
  },
  {
   "i": 70,
   "start": 229.562,
   "end": 232.30599999999998,
   "startFrame": 6887,
   "endFrame": 6969,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "Below, someone was screaming not to push."
  },
  {
   "i": 71,
   "start": 232.856,
   "end": 235.32,
   "startFrame": 6986,
   "endFrame": 7060,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "But above, people kept pouring down."
  },
  {
   "i": 72,
   "start": 235.87,
   "end": 237.914,
   "startFrame": 7076,
   "endFrame": 7137,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "I got pressed against the handrail."
  },
  {
   "i": 73,
   "start": 238.264,
   "end": 241.838,
   "startFrame": 7148,
   "endFrame": 7255,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "My backpack caught on something behind me, yanking my shoulder back."
  },
  {
   "i": 74,
   "start": 242.188,
   "end": 244.779,
   "startFrame": 7266,
   "endFrame": 7343,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "I turned, but there wasn't room to reach it."
  },
  {
   "i": 75,
   "start": 245.329,
   "end": 247.207,
   "startFrame": 7360,
   "endFrame": 7416,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "A man slammed into my back."
  },
  {
   "i": 76,
   "start": 247.757,
   "end": 248.537,
   "startFrame": 7433,
   "endFrame": 7456,
   "words": 1,
   "text": "\"Move!\""
  },
  {
   "i": 77,
   "start": 249.087,
   "end": 252.01,
   "startFrame": 7473,
   "endFrame": 7560,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "I tried to say I was stuck, but he wasn't listening."
  },
  {
   "i": 78,
   "start": 252.56,
   "end": 256.364,
   "startFrame": 7577,
   "endFrame": 7691,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "I slipped one strap off my shoulder, reached back, and yanked hard."
  },
  {
   "i": 79,
   "start": 256.714,
   "end": 258.808,
   "startFrame": 7701,
   "endFrame": 7764,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "The bag tore free from the railing."
  },
  {
   "i": 80,
   "start": 259.158,
   "end": 262.502,
   "startFrame": 7775,
   "endFrame": 7875,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "My hand scraped against a metal edge, and it stung badly."
  },
  {
   "i": 81,
   "start": 263.052,
   "end": 265.619,
   "startFrame": 7892,
   "endFrame": 7969,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "At the landing there was a door standing open."
  },
  {
   "i": 82,
   "start": 265.969,
   "end": 269.351,
   "startFrame": 7979,
   "endFrame": 8081,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "I squeezed past the person beside me and nearly fell through it."
  },
  {
   "i": 83,
   "start": 269.901,
   "end": 271.651,
   "startFrame": 8097,
   "endFrame": 8150,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "It was a staff corridor."
  },
  {
   "i": 84,
   "start": 272.201,
   "end": 277.203,
   "startFrame": 8166,
   "endFrame": 8316,
   "words": 19,
   "text": "I followed the arrows toward an exit, down a ramp, and pushed through a door into a loading area."
  },
  {
   "i": 85,
   "start": 277.753,
   "end": 281.072,
   "startFrame": 8333,
   "endFrame": 8432,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "Out here there were only trucks and crates stacked against the wall."
  },
  {
   "i": 86,
   "start": 281.622,
   "end": 283.921,
   "startFrame": 8449,
   "endFrame": 8518,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "I walked a few more steps and sat down."
  },
  {
   "i": 87,
   "start": 284.471,
   "end": 286.04200000000003,
   "startFrame": 8534,
   "endFrame": 8581,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "My hand was bleeding."
  },
  {
   "i": 88,
   "start": 286.392,
   "end": 291.305,
   "startFrame": 8592,
   "endFrame": 8739,
   "words": 19,
   "text": "I pressed a tissue against it, but my hand was shaking too hard, and I dropped the whole pack."
  },
  {
   "i": 89,
   "start": 291.855,
   "end": 295.824,
   "startFrame": 8756,
   "endFrame": 8875,
   "words": 18,
   "text": "I sat there for a moment before I could bring myself to bend down and pick it up."
  },
  {
   "i": 90,
   "start": 296.374,
   "end": 299.04200000000003,
   "startFrame": 8891,
   "endFrame": 8971,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "I drank a few sips of water and checked my phone."
  },
  {
   "i": 91,
   "start": 299.592,
   "end": 300.921,
   "startFrame": 8988,
   "endFrame": 9028,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "No missed calls."
  },
  {
   "i": 92,
   "start": 301.471,
   "end": 306.525,
   "startFrame": 9044,
   "endFrame": 9196,
   "words": 20,
   "text": "I wanted to go home, but every time I thought about the people out in the hallway, I stopped myself."
  },
  {
   "i": 93,
   "start": 307.075,
   "end": 310.279,
   "startFrame": 9212,
   "endFrame": 9308,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "Through the gap between two trucks, I could see the street."
  },
  {
   "i": 94,
   "start": 310.629,
   "end": 312.965,
   "startFrame": 9319,
   "endFrame": 9389,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "Someone ran past the mouth of the alley."
  },
  {
   "i": 95,
   "start": 313.315,
   "end": 316.621,
   "startFrame": 9399,
   "endFrame": 9499,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "Behind them, two others were walking, slow and steady."
  },
  {
   "i": 96,
   "start": 317.171,
   "end": 319.993,
   "startFrame": 9515,
   "endFrame": 9600,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "A car parked nearby started blaring its alarm."
  },
  {
   "i": 97,
   "start": 320.543,
   "end": 323.785,
   "startFrame": 9616,
   "endFrame": 9714,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "The two walking figures stopped, and turned toward the car."
  },
  {
   "i": 98,
   "start": 324.335,
   "end": 328.011,
   "startFrame": 9730,
   "endFrame": 9840,
   "words": 14,
   "text": "I watched them move to the door and slap their hands against the glass."
  },
  {
   "i": 99,
   "start": 328.561,
   "end": 332.02,
   "startFrame": 9857,
   "endFrame": 9961,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "From inside the mall, a fire alarm started ringing too."
  },
  {
   "i": 100,
   "start": 332.37,
   "end": 335.102,
   "startFrame": 9971,
   "endFrame": 10053,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "Someone near the end of the street turned around."
  },
  {
   "i": 101,
   "start": 335.452,
   "end": 336.526,
   "startFrame": 10064,
   "endFrame": 10096,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "Then another."
  },
  {
   "i": 102,
   "start": 337.076,
   "end": 338.443,
   "startFrame": 10112,
   "endFrame": 10153,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "I ducked down low."
  },
  {
   "i": 103,
   "start": 338.993,
   "end": 341.21500000000003,
   "startFrame": 10170,
   "endFrame": 10236,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "I didn't yet know what was wrong with them."
  },
  {
   "i": 104,
   "start": 341.565,
   "end": 344.22,
   "startFrame": 10247,
   "endFrame": 10327,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "But I had seen enough not to want to get closer."
  },
  {
   "i": 105,
   "start": 344.77,
   "end": 352.451,
   "startFrame": 10343,
   "endFrame": 10574,
   "words": 31,
   "text": "When the loading area went quiet, I tore a strip of fabric from a shirt in my backpack, wrapped it around my hand, and left through the alley at the back."
  },
  {
   "i": 106,
   "start": 353.001,
   "end": 355.452,
   "startFrame": 10590,
   "endFrame": 10664,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "I kept away from the direction of the ringing."
  },
  {
   "i": 107,
   "start": 356.002,
   "end": 358.645,
   "startFrame": 10680,
   "endFrame": 10759,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "By afternoon, I had been walking for hours."
  },
  {
   "i": 108,
   "start": 359.195,
   "end": 361.965,
   "startFrame": 10776,
   "endFrame": 10859,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "I finished off a snack bar and was still hungry."
  },
  {
   "i": 109,
   "start": 362.315,
   "end": 364.231,
   "startFrame": 10869,
   "endFrame": 10927,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "My feet had started to burn."
  },
  {
   "i": 110,
   "start": 364.581,
   "end": 367.849,
   "startFrame": 10937,
   "endFrame": 11035,
   "words": 13,
   "text": "I just wanted somewhere to sit down and some way to reach someone."
  },
  {
   "i": 111,
   "start": 368.399,
   "end": 372.368,
   "startFrame": 11052,
   "endFrame": 11171,
   "words": 17,
   "text": "At the end of a row of houses, I found one with its door open a crack."
  },
  {
   "i": 112,
   "start": 372.918,
   "end": 374.885,
   "startFrame": 11188,
   "endFrame": 11247,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "I stood at the gate for a moment."
  },
  {
   "i": 113,
   "start": 375.235,
   "end": 377.316,
   "startFrame": 11257,
   "endFrame": 11319,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "No one in sight, no sound."
  },
  {
   "i": 114,
   "start": 377.866,
   "end": 379.565,
   "startFrame": 11336,
   "endFrame": 11387,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "I called out, softly."
  },
  {
   "i": 115,
   "start": 380.115,
   "end": 381.367,
   "startFrame": 11403,
   "endFrame": 11441,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "\"Is anyone home?\""
  },
  {
   "i": 116,
   "start": 381.91700000000003,
   "end": 383.04200000000003,
   "startFrame": 11458,
   "endFrame": 11491,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "No answer."
  },
  {
   "i": 117,
   "start": 383.592,
   "end": 385.444,
   "startFrame": 11508,
   "endFrame": 11563,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "There was a crack around the lock."
  },
  {
   "i": 118,
   "start": 385.794,
   "end": 390.465,
   "startFrame": 11574,
   "endFrame": 11714,
   "words": 18,
   "text": "I saw it, but told myself the owner might have damaged the door themselves on the way out."
  },
  {
   "i": 119,
   "start": 391.015,
   "end": 393.403,
   "startFrame": 11730,
   "endFrame": 11802,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "I pushed the door open and stepped inside."
  },
  {
   "i": 120,
   "start": 393.953,
   "end": 395.651,
   "startFrame": 11819,
   "endFrame": 11870,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "The living room was empty."
  },
  {
   "i": 121,
   "start": 396.001,
   "end": 399.435,
   "startFrame": 11880,
   "endFrame": 11983,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "A chair had been knocked over, things scattered across the floor."
  },
  {
   "i": 122,
   "start": 399.78499999999997,
   "end": 402.581,
   "startFrame": 11994,
   "endFrame": 12077,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "A half-finished glass of water sat on the table."
  },
  {
   "i": 123,
   "start": 403.131,
   "end": 406.564,
   "startFrame": 12094,
   "endFrame": 12197,
   "words": 15,
   "text": "I had just passed the foot of the stairs when I heard a sound above."
  },
  {
   "i": 124,
   "start": 407.114,
   "end": 408.099,
   "startFrame": 12213,
   "endFrame": 12243,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "A footstep."
  },
  {
   "i": 125,
   "start": 408.649,
   "end": 409.659,
   "startFrame": 12259,
   "endFrame": 12290,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "I looked up."
  },
  {
   "i": 126,
   "start": 410.209,
   "end": 414.318,
   "startFrame": 12306,
   "endFrame": 12430,
   "words": 13,
   "text": "Someone was standing at the top of the stairs, half-hidden behind the railing."
  },
  {
   "i": 127,
   "start": 414.868,
   "end": 416.236,
   "startFrame": 12446,
   "endFrame": 12487,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "\"Sorry,\" I said."
  },
  {
   "i": 128,
   "start": 416.586,
   "end": 417.723,
   "startFrame": 12498,
   "endFrame": 12532,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "\"I just need—\""
  },
  {
   "i": 129,
   "start": 418.273,
   "end": 420.24,
   "startFrame": 12548,
   "endFrame": 12607,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "The figure started coming down."
  },
  {
   "i": 130,
   "start": 420.79,
   "end": 423.42,
   "startFrame": 12624,
   "endFrame": 12703,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "I saw the blood on their shirt, then the face."
  },
  {
   "i": 131,
   "start": 423.97,
   "end": 427.136,
   "startFrame": 12719,
   "endFrame": 12814,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "I turned too fast and knocked into the table by the door."
  },
  {
   "i": 132,
   "start": 427.486,
   "end": 429.057,
   "startFrame": 12825,
   "endFrame": 12872,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "A vase fell and shattered."
  },
  {
   "i": 133,
   "start": 429.60699999999997,
   "end": 430.885,
   "startFrame": 12888,
   "endFrame": 12927,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "I ran outside."
  },
  {
   "i": 134,
   "start": 431.435,
   "end": 434.333,
   "startFrame": 12943,
   "endFrame": 13030,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "Not until the end of the street did I dare look back."
  },
  {
   "i": 135,
   "start": 434.883,
   "end": 439.464,
   "startFrame": 13046,
   "endFrame": 13184,
   "words": 16,
   "text": "The figure had reached the gate, standing in a patch of leftover sunlight on the sidewalk."
  },
  {
   "i": 136,
   "start": 440.014,
   "end": 443.83,
   "startFrame": 13200,
   "endFrame": 13315,
   "words": 16,
   "text": "I turned down a different alley and kept going until the house was out of sight."
  },
  {
   "i": 137,
   "start": 444.38,
   "end": 448.362,
   "startFrame": 13331,
   "endFrame": 13451,
   "words": 16,
   "text": "When I finally stopped, I had to brace my hands on my knees just to breathe."
  },
  {
   "i": 138,
   "start": 448.912,
   "end": 451.491,
   "startFrame": 13467,
   "endFrame": 13545,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "I had seen the broken door before I went in."
  },
  {
   "i": 139,
   "start": 452.041,
   "end": 453.587,
   "startFrame": 13561,
   "endFrame": 13608,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "I knew I shouldn't have."
  },
  {
   "i": 140,
   "start": 454.137,
   "end": 457.124,
   "startFrame": 13624,
   "endFrame": 13714,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "But I was tired, and I wanted that house to be empty."
  },
  {
   "i": 141,
   "start": 457.674,
   "end": 459.399,
   "startFrame": 13730,
   "endFrame": 13782,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "The light was starting to go."
  },
  {
   "i": 142,
   "start": 459.949,
   "end": 462.489,
   "startFrame": 13798,
   "endFrame": 13875,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "I had stopped looking for anywhere with a bed."
  },
  {
   "i": 143,
   "start": 463.039,
   "end": 466.371,
   "startFrame": 13891,
   "endFrame": 13991,
   "words": 13,
   "text": "The parking garage at the end of the street had its gate locked."
  },
  {
   "i": 144,
   "start": 466.721,
   "end": 469.491,
   "startFrame": 14002,
   "endFrame": 14085,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "I stood outside and looked in, called out once."
  },
  {
   "i": 145,
   "start": 469.841,
   "end": 470.966,
   "startFrame": 14095,
   "endFrame": 14129,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "No answer."
  },
  {
   "i": 146,
   "start": 471.516,
   "end": 473.827,
   "startFrame": 14145,
   "endFrame": 14215,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "I tried the apartment block next door."
  },
  {
   "i": 147,
   "start": 474.177,
   "end": 477.202,
   "startFrame": 14225,
   "endFrame": 14316,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "Just past the first flight of stairs, I smelled smoke."
  },
  {
   "i": 148,
   "start": 477.552,
   "end": 480.029,
   "startFrame": 14327,
   "endFrame": 14401,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "Somewhere above, an alarm kept ringing."
  },
  {
   "i": 149,
   "start": 480.579,
   "end": 481.755,
   "startFrame": 14417,
   "endFrame": 14453,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "I turned back."
  },
  {
   "i": 150,
   "start": 482.305,
   "end": 486.466,
   "startFrame": 14469,
   "endFrame": 14594,
   "words": 14,
   "text": "Behind a row of shops, I found a small building used for maintenance storage."
  },
  {
   "i": 151,
   "start": 486.816,
   "end": 489.242,
   "startFrame": 14604,
   "endFrame": 14677,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "A steel door, no windows on the wall."
  },
  {
   "i": 152,
   "start": 489.592,
   "end": 492.885,
   "startFrame": 14688,
   "endFrame": 14787,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "At the back, a low window opened onto a narrow yard."
  },
  {
   "i": 153,
   "start": 493.435,
   "end": 495.797,
   "startFrame": 14803,
   "endFrame": 14874,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "I walked around it before trying the handle."
  },
  {
   "i": 154,
   "start": 496.347,
   "end": 497.65,
   "startFrame": 14890,
   "endFrame": 14930,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "It wasn't locked."
  },
  {
   "i": 155,
   "start": 498.2,
   "end": 500.716,
   "startFrame": 14946,
   "endFrame": 15021,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "I stood outside and called in, then waited."
  },
  {
   "i": 156,
   "start": 501.266,
   "end": 502.39,
   "startFrame": 15038,
   "endFrame": 15072,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "Nothing moved."
  },
  {
   "i": 157,
   "start": 502.94,
   "end": 506.501,
   "startFrame": 15088,
   "endFrame": 15195,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "Inside were tool shelves, a few plastic bins, and a table."
  },
  {
   "i": 158,
   "start": 506.851,
   "end": 510.4,
   "startFrame": 15206,
   "endFrame": 15312,
   "words": 13,
   "text": "I switched on the flashlight and checked the blind corner behind the door."
  },
  {
   "i": 159,
   "start": 510.95,
   "end": 511.947,
   "startFrame": 15328,
   "endFrame": 15358,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "No one."
  },
  {
   "i": 160,
   "start": 512.497,
   "end": 516.441,
   "startFrame": 15375,
   "endFrame": 15493,
   "words": 16,
   "text": "The back window was wide enough to climb through if I set my bag down first."
  },
  {
   "i": 161,
   "start": 516.7909999999999,
   "end": 519.191,
   "startFrame": 15504,
   "endFrame": 15576,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "I tried the latch, then closed it again."
  },
  {
   "i": 162,
   "start": 519.741,
   "end": 521.797,
   "startFrame": 15592,
   "endFrame": 15654,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "Then I went back to the front door."
  },
  {
   "i": 163,
   "start": 522.347,
   "end": 523.765,
   "startFrame": 15670,
   "endFrame": 15713,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "The bolt still worked."
  },
  {
   "i": 164,
   "start": 524.115,
   "end": 526.758,
   "startFrame": 15723,
   "endFrame": 15803,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "I slid it shut, pulled on it twice to check."
  },
  {
   "i": 165,
   "start": 527.308,
   "end": 529.364,
   "startFrame": 15819,
   "endFrame": 15881,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "The room smelled of oil and dust."
  },
  {
   "i": 166,
   "start": 529.7139999999999,
   "end": 534.665,
   "startFrame": 15891,
   "endFrame": 16040,
   "words": 18,
   "text": "The concrete floor was cold, and there was nothing to lie on but a few flattened cardboard sheets."
  },
  {
   "i": 167,
   "start": 535.215,
   "end": 537.807,
   "startFrame": 16056,
   "endFrame": 16134,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "I laid them out against the wall and sat down."
  },
  {
   "i": 168,
   "start": 538.357,
   "end": 541.485,
   "startFrame": 16151,
   "endFrame": 16245,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "This time, before I ate, I looked back at the door."
  },
  {
   "i": 169,
   "start": 542.035,
   "end": 543.478,
   "startFrame": 16261,
   "endFrame": 16304,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "It was still closed."
  },
  {
   "i": 170,
   "start": 544.028,
   "end": 546.85,
   "startFrame": 16321,
   "endFrame": 16406,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "I finished the last snack bar and took out my phone."
  },
  {
   "i": 171,
   "start": 547.4,
   "end": 548.78,
   "startFrame": 16422,
   "endFrame": 16463,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "No new messages."
  },
  {
   "i": 172,
   "start": 549.13,
   "end": 551.096,
   "startFrame": 16474,
   "endFrame": 16533,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "Not a single bar of signal."
  },
  {
   "i": 173,
   "start": 551.646,
   "end": 554.302,
   "startFrame": 16549,
   "endFrame": 16629,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "I dimmed the screen and set it down beside me."
  },
  {
   "i": 174,
   "start": 554.852,
   "end": 556.627,
   "startFrame": 16646,
   "endFrame": 16699,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "I don't know when I fell asleep."
  },
  {
   "i": 175,
   "start": 557.177,
   "end": 559.399,
   "startFrame": 16715,
   "endFrame": 16782,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "A sound outside the door woke me up."
  },
  {
   "i": 176,
   "start": 559.949,
   "end": 563.178,
   "startFrame": 16798,
   "endFrame": 16895,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "I sat up fast and knocked the water bottle with my hand."
  },
  {
   "i": 177,
   "start": 563.528,
   "end": 567.88,
   "startFrame": 16906,
   "endFrame": 17036,
   "words": 16,
   "text": "It rolled off the cardboard, bounced on the floor, and hit the leg of a shelf."
  },
  {
   "i": 178,
   "start": 568.43,
   "end": 569.938,
   "startFrame": 17053,
   "endFrame": 17098,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "The sound wasn't loud."
  },
  {
   "i": 179,
   "start": 570.488,
   "end": 573.258,
   "startFrame": 17115,
   "endFrame": 17198,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "But right after, the footsteps outside stopped."
  },
  {
   "i": 180,
   "start": 573.808,
   "end": 575.226,
   "startFrame": 17214,
   "endFrame": 17257,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "I looked at the door."
  },
  {
   "i": 181,
   "start": 575.776,
   "end": 577.832,
   "startFrame": 17273,
   "endFrame": 17335,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "The handle moved, just slightly."
  },
  {
   "i": 182,
   "start": 578.382,
   "end": 579.749,
   "startFrame": 17351,
   "endFrame": 17392,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "Then came a push."
  },
  {
   "i": 183,
   "start": 580.299,
   "end": 582.6610000000001,
   "startFrame": 17409,
   "endFrame": 17480,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "I switched the flashlight on without thinking."
  },
  {
   "i": 184,
   "start": 583.011,
   "end": 585.17,
   "startFrame": 17490,
   "endFrame": 17555,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "The beam shook against the steel door."
  },
  {
   "i": 185,
   "start": 585.72,
   "end": 586.908,
   "startFrame": 17572,
   "endFrame": 17607,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "Another push."
  },
  {
   "i": 186,
   "start": 587.458,
   "end": 589.795,
   "startFrame": 17624,
   "endFrame": 17694,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "I turned it off and backed against the wall."
  },
  {
   "i": 187,
   "start": 590.145,
   "end": 591.971,
   "startFrame": 17704,
   "endFrame": 17759,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "My heel scraped the floor."
  },
  {
   "i": 188,
   "start": 592.521,
   "end": 596.146,
   "startFrame": 17776,
   "endFrame": 17884,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "Outside, a scratching sound started right where I had been standing."
  },
  {
   "i": 189,
   "start": 596.696,
   "end": 597.872,
   "startFrame": 17901,
   "endFrame": 17936,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "I went still."
  },
  {
   "i": 190,
   "start": 598.422,
   "end": 600.478,
   "startFrame": 17953,
   "endFrame": 18014,
   "words": 7,
   "text": "The door rattled a few more times."
  },
  {
   "i": 191,
   "start": 600.828,
   "end": 605.511,
   "startFrame": 18025,
   "endFrame": 18165,
   "words": 18,
   "text": "The bolt held, but every sound of metal against metal made me think of the moment it wouldn't."
  },
  {
   "i": 192,
   "start": 606.061,
   "end": 608.653,
   "startFrame": 18182,
   "endFrame": 18260,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "I wanted to drag the table over to brace it."
  },
  {
   "i": 193,
   "start": 609.203,
   "end": 611.769,
   "startFrame": 18276,
   "endFrame": 18353,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "But the table was on the other side of the room."
  },
  {
   "i": 194,
   "start": 612.119,
   "end": 616.025,
   "startFrame": 18364,
   "endFrame": 18481,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "I remembered the bottle rolling, and the footsteps stopping right after."
  },
  {
   "i": 195,
   "start": 616.375,
   "end": 617.5889999999999,
   "startFrame": 18491,
   "endFrame": 18528,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "I didn't get up."
  },
  {
   "i": 196,
   "start": 618.139,
   "end": 622.095,
   "startFrame": 18544,
   "endFrame": 18663,
   "words": 13,
   "text": "I sat against the wall, arms around my knees, trying to breathe slowly."
  },
  {
   "i": 197,
   "start": 622.645,
   "end": 624.778,
   "startFrame": 18679,
   "endFrame": 18743,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "The noise outside went on for a while."
  },
  {
   "i": 198,
   "start": 625.328,
   "end": 627.09,
   "startFrame": 18760,
   "endFrame": 18813,
   "words": 6,
   "text": "Then it began to thin out."
  },
  {
   "i": 199,
   "start": 627.64,
   "end": 630.003,
   "startFrame": 18829,
   "endFrame": 18900,
   "words": 10,
   "text": "I didn't know how many of them were out there."
  },
  {
   "i": 200,
   "start": 630.353,
   "end": 633.608,
   "startFrame": 18911,
   "endFrame": 19008,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "I didn't know if they had left, or were just standing, waiting."
  },
  {
   "i": 201,
   "start": 634.158,
   "end": 637.451,
   "startFrame": 19025,
   "endFrame": 19124,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "When my legs went numb, I still didn't dare stretch them out."
  },
  {
   "i": 202,
   "start": 638.001,
   "end": 641.945,
   "startFrame": 19140,
   "endFrame": 19258,
   "words": 13,
   "text": "Much later, there was the sound of glass breaking, somewhere in the distance."
  },
  {
   "i": 203,
   "start": 642.494,
   "end": 644.487,
   "startFrame": 19275,
   "endFrame": 19335,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "The footsteps outside shifted."
  },
  {
   "i": 204,
   "start": 644.837,
   "end": 648.474,
   "startFrame": 19345,
   "endFrame": 19454,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "The drag of their feet on the concrete grew fainter, then disappeared."
  },
  {
   "i": 205,
   "start": 649.024,
   "end": 652.164,
   "startFrame": 19471,
   "endFrame": 19565,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "I waited a long time before I reached for the water bottle."
  },
  {
   "i": 206,
   "start": 652.7139999999999,
   "end": 655.191,
   "startFrame": 19581,
   "endFrame": 19656,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "This time, I held it with both hands."
  },
  {
   "i": 207,
   "start": 655.741,
   "end": 658.422,
   "startFrame": 19672,
   "endFrame": 19753,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "Near dawn, I managed to sleep a little more."
  },
  {
   "i": 208,
   "start": 658.972,
   "end": 663.426,
   "startFrame": 19769,
   "endFrame": 19903,
   "words": 20,
   "text": "When I woke, my neck was so stiff I had to turn my whole body just to look behind me."
  },
  {
   "i": 209,
   "start": 663.976,
   "end": 667.065,
   "startFrame": 19919,
   "endFrame": 20012,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "I cracked open the back window and looked down at the yard."
  },
  {
   "i": 210,
   "start": 667.615,
   "end": 668.804,
   "startFrame": 20028,
   "endFrame": 20064,
   "words": 3,
   "text": "No one there."
  },
  {
   "i": 211,
   "start": 669.354,
   "end": 672.099,
   "startFrame": 20081,
   "endFrame": 20163,
   "words": 11,
   "text": "I had a bit more than one bottle of water left."
  },
  {
   "i": 212,
   "start": 672.449,
   "end": 673.803,
   "startFrame": 20173,
   "endFrame": 20214,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "The food was gone."
  },
  {
   "i": 213,
   "start": 674.153,
   "end": 677.013,
   "startFrame": 20225,
   "endFrame": 20310,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "My hand was faintly swollen under the dirty wrap."
  },
  {
   "i": 214,
   "start": 677.363,
   "end": 681.562,
   "startFrame": 20321,
   "endFrame": 20447,
   "words": 16,
   "text": "I needed to wash it, needed to eat, and needed to know where I actually was."
  },
  {
   "i": 215,
   "start": 682.112,
   "end": 684.27,
   "startFrame": 20463,
   "endFrame": 20528,
   "words": 8,
   "text": "There was still no reply on my phone."
  },
  {
   "i": 216,
   "start": 684.82,
   "end": 688.432,
   "startFrame": 20545,
   "endFrame": 20653,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "I was about to try calling again when a new notification appeared."
  },
  {
   "i": 217,
   "start": 688.982,
   "end": 690.4639999999999,
   "startFrame": 20669,
   "endFrame": 20714,
   "words": 2,
   "text": "Evacuation point."
  },
  {
   "i": 218,
   "start": 690.814,
   "end": 693.138,
   "startFrame": 20724,
   "endFrame": 20794,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "River Crossing Bridge, north bank."
  },
  {
   "i": 219,
   "start": 693.488,
   "end": 695.352,
   "startFrame": 20805,
   "endFrame": 20861,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "Receiving until twelve noon."
  },
  {
   "i": 220,
   "start": 695.902,
   "end": 697.665,
   "startFrame": 20877,
   "endFrame": 20930,
   "words": 5,
   "text": "I read the address again."
  },
  {
   "i": 221,
   "start": 698.215,
   "end": 701.814,
   "startFrame": 20946,
   "endFrame": 21054,
   "words": 15,
   "text": "Yesterday I had walked into the mall because I saw a guard at the door."
  },
  {
   "i": 222,
   "start": 702.164,
   "end": 705.993,
   "startFrame": 21065,
   "endFrame": 21180,
   "words": 17,
   "text": "Now I was about to head toward a place that might be just as full of people."
  },
  {
   "i": 223,
   "start": 706.543,
   "end": 710.066,
   "startFrame": 21196,
   "endFrame": 21302,
   "words": 13,
   "text": "I sat there a little longer, looking at the bottle in my hand."
  },
  {
   "i": 224,
   "start": 710.616,
   "end": 714.088,
   "startFrame": 21318,
   "endFrame": 21423,
   "words": 14,
   "text": "If I stayed here, I would still have to go outside by noon anyway."
  },
  {
   "i": 225,
   "start": 714.638,
   "end": 718.926,
   "startFrame": 21439,
   "endFrame": 21568,
   "words": 14,
   "text": "I saved the evacuation address, in case the phone lost signal on the way."
  },
  {
   "i": 226,
   "start": 719.476,
   "end": 723.585,
   "startFrame": 21584,
   "endFrame": 21708,
   "words": 17,
   "text": "Then I put on the backpack, checked my pocket to make sure the phone was still there."
  },
  {
   "i": 227,
   "start": 724.135,
   "end": 726.332,
   "startFrame": 21724,
   "endFrame": 21790,
   "words": 4,
   "text": "Outside, footsteps passed by."
  },
  {
   "i": 228,
   "start": 726.882,
   "end": 729.346,
   "startFrame": 21806,
   "endFrame": 21880,
   "words": 9,
   "text": "I put my hand on the bolt, and waited."
  },
  {
   "i": 229,
   "start": 729.896,
   "end": 733.355,
   "startFrame": 21897,
   "endFrame": 22001,
   "words": 12,
   "text": "Only when I couldn't hear anything anymore did I open the door."
  }
 ],
 "chapters": []
}